	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><span> <strong>No Action Cost</strong> </span>- Self - Magical</p><p><em>Trigger: When you use @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.7Gnq3qfLzpIuRs0U]{Meld With Shadows} or @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.Z1WevTWQhrRwwyp8]{Hijack Shadow}.</em></p><p>You can choose to become partially insubstantial, taking on shadow in the place of your body.</p><ul><li><p>You have resistance to &amp;reference[bludgeoning], &amp;reference[piercing], and &amp;reference[slashing] damage.</p></li><li><p>You have vulnerability to &amp;reference[radiant] damage.</p></li><li><p>When Meld With Shadows or Hijack Shadow ends, this ability ends.</p></li></ul>",
			"chat": ""
		},
